      "id": "claim_adda98b4a71c41edb3b40eaa2dc2d2b1",
      "statement": "The OPENWEBUI branch requires OPENWEBUI_URL and OPENWEBUI_API_KEY and builds an OpenAI-compatible OpenAiChatModel at the configured URL with a 10-minute timeout.",
